      "comment": "POCKETFULLOFCASH (3) comes a long way back in grade having run in he G3 Blue Sapphire & G2 Danehill his past two. Went way too hard in front last time and faded, now he comes back to a BM64 and 1100m which suits much better. HARRY MET SALLY (1) resumes. He was last seen running second to Blind Raise who has gone on to run second in a Caulfield Guineas. Off a long break here so watch the betting. LADY OF POMPEII (7) resumes having knocked off her maiden at start two before a spell. She should be ready to run well fresh. SOUTHERN SWAY (8) was a tidy winner on debut here over 1000m and has claims with natural improvement. MOUNTJOY (2) tackled some good races last time in and looks well placed fresh.",
